{
  "build": "2026-11-16-costume-packs",
  "seq": 50,
  "ref": "6314be422dfd341176d827771b2d396b484576a6",
  "title": "learnwithmrcedric: costume packs and the carnival",
  "notes": [
    "Release 50 needs server code: paste App.gs and Hub.gs from the code page, then deploy a new version. Until then students keep the release 49 pages",
    "Costumes come from four packs of 3 pieces at 80 points each. The third piece is always Rare or better, and a piece a student already has is a spare they can sell for a few points",
    "66 new costume pieces, with the Supernova uniform as the rarest. The chances are shown to students on the Packs tab",
    "The night market is now the Carnival, with a Ferris wheel and a roller coaster students can sit on, a mini map and a new avatar stage",
    "The prize tab in your sheet keeps its name, Night market, so the prizes in it stay where they are"
  ],
